      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JACKY LEGS (8) is rarely out of the finish, recording 10 places from 18 starts. Continues to race well, filling the minors at the last three starts, the latest when third (30.57) at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from five starts. Sure to be about the mark. FUNKY LADY (3) was well in the market last time but only managed seventh (19.13), beaten 8 lengths. Finished second the start before. Should be in this for a long way. SON OF MATES (7) produced a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 520m behind Left Till Last (30.94) in a Maiden. Expected to feature in the finish. ACTIVE EGO (2) will be hard to beat despite making his debut at this circuit.",
